<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="it">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Golden Festival</title>
<style>
body {
margin: 0;
font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
background: #0b0b0f;
color: white;
}

header {
height: 100vh;
display: flex;
flex-direction: column;
justify-content: center;
align-items: center;
text-align: center;
background: radial-gradient(circle at top, #b8860b, #0b0b0f 60%);
}

h1 {
font-size: 60px;
margin: 0;
color: gold;
}

p {
font-size: 20px;
opacity: 0.8;
}

button {
padding: 15px 25px;
margin-top: 20px;
border: none;
background: gold;
color: black;
font-weight: bold;
cursor: pointer;
border-radius: 10px;
}

section {
padding: 60px 20px;
max-width: 900px;
margin: auto;
}

h2 {
color: gold;
}

.card {
background: #16161d;
padding: 20px;
margin: 10px 0;
border-radius: 10px;
}

footer {
text-align: center;
padding: 30px;
opacity: 0.6;
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
<h1>Golden Festival</h1>
<p>18.07.2026 • Lugano, Svizzera</p>
<p>3’500 persone • Festival musicale estivo</p>
<button onclick="window.location.href='#tickets'">Acquista Biglietti</button>
</header>

<section>
<h2>Line-up</h2>
<div class="card">🔥 David Guetta (Headliner)</div>
<div class="card">Make Plain</div>
<div class="card">Dreamshade</div>
<div class="card">CoreLeoni</div>
<div class="card">The Vad Vuc</div>
</section>

<section id="tickets">
<h2>Biglietti</h2>
<div class="card">Standard – CHF 310 <br><button>Compra ora</button></div>
<div class="card">VIP 1 – Comfort <br><button>Compra VIP</button></div>
<div class="card">VIP 2 – Front Stage <br><button>Compra VIP Premium</button></div>
</section>

<section>
<h2>Info Evento</h2>
<div class="card">
Festival musicale estivo a Lugano con artisti internazionali e locali.
Valorizzazione della scena musicale ticinese.
</div>
</section>

<section>
<h2>Location</h2>
<div class="card">
Lugano, Svizzera<br>
Area evento da confermare
</div>
</section>

<footer>
Golden Festival 2026 • Lugano
</footer>

</body>
</html>
